      "text": "A1 > B1 > C1 > D1 > E1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A1 > B1 > C1 > D1 > E1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2VBfq2qhAGW_yISSUMQpI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 845.7144775390625,
      "y": 3104.2142944335938,
      "width": 1017.7144775390626,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 998768914,
      "version": 1040,
      "versionNonce": 1334538824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794575444481,
      "created": 1794476747570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For sure A1 is the first place, but for 2nd place there is a possibilty A2, A3,...A5 is faster then B1.\nand since A2> A3 > A4 > A5 so for 2nd place the competition is between B1 and A2.\nSo in Race 7 we are going to run A2 vs B1 for sure, but we have postion of 3 horses left and since we\nhave to find in min. races, so lets see what can be the 3rd place horse\n\nSo, in 3rd place, currently C1 is there, but we know there possibility in A2 vs B1. \n-> if A2 wins then order is A1 > A2 > (B1 vs A3)\n-> if B1 wins then order is A1 > B1 > (A2 vs B2 vs C1)\nThe top two finishers are then 2nd and 3rd",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For sure A1 is the first place, but for 2nd place there is a possibilty A2, A3,...A5 is faster then B1. and since A2> A3 > A4 > A5 so for 2nd place the competition is between B1 and A2.\nSo in Race 7 we are going to run A2 vs B1 for sure, but we have postion of 3 horses left and since we have to find in min. races, so lets see what can be the 3rd place horse\n\nSo, in 3rd place, currently C1 is there, but we know there possibility in A2 vs B1. \n-> if A2 wins then order is A1 > A2 > (B1 vs A3)\n-> if B1 wins then order is A1 > B1 > (A2 vs B2 vs C1)\nThe top two finishers are then 2nd and 3rd",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
